I am back in the flat.
My flat is very quiet today.
It is Sunday afternoon in Berlin.
I sit at the table.
My table is small, but practical.
Here is my laptop.
I open the laptop.
I put the chocolate next to the laptop.
This is a chocolate from Germany.
I look at the mobile phone.
It is still early in Mexico.
I check the camera.
The light in the room is good.
I start the video call.
The screen is still black.
I am a little excited.
Who is already awake over there?
Is it my mother or my father?
I wait for an answer.
